            ],
            "text": "SIMONE, 40s, a trauma nurse with twelve-hour circles under her eyes, is eating alone.\nMaya sits across from her uninvited.\nMAYA\nYou worked the West Side clinic flood response in '19.\nSIMONE\n(without looking up)\nDo I know you?\nMAYA\nNot yet. I need someone who can work with almost\nnothing and keep people alive.\nSIMONE\nThat's my whole job.\nMAYA\nThen this should feel familiar.\nSimone finally looks up. Something in Maya's tone cuts through the exhaustion.",
            "description": "SIMONE, 40s, a trauma nurse with twelve-hour circles under her eyes, is eating alone.\nMaya sits across from her uninvited.\nMAYA\nYou worked the West Side clinic flood response in '19.\nSIMONE\n(without looking up)\nDo I know you?\nMAYA\nNot yet. I need someone who can work with almost\nnothing and keep people alive.\nSIMONE\nThat's my whole job.\nMAYA\nThen this should feel familiar.\nSimone finally looks up. Something in Maya's tone cuts through the exhaustion.",
