          "scene_008": {
            "scene_id": "scene_008",
            "heading": "INT. COMMUNITY GARDEN, PILSEN \u2014 DAY",
            "location": "COMMUNITY GARDEN, PILSEN \u2014 DAY",
            "time_of_day": "",
            "characters": [
              "ELENA",
              "MAYA"
            ],
            "text": "ELENA, 60s, is tending rows of winter kale. She doesn't stop working when Maya\napproaches.\nELENA\nYou the one who's been asking about hydroponics at\nthe library?\nMAYA\nYes.\nELENA\nYou don't have soil. So you're growing indoors.\nMAYA\nRooftop. Maybe indoors eventually.\nELENA\n(still not looking up)\nWhy?\nMAYA\nBecause I think the stores are going to stop.\nElena pauses. She looks at Maya for a long moment.\nELENA\nYou're not the first person to feel that.\nMAYA\nI might be the first one doing something about it.\nElena sets down her trowel.\nMAYA AND HER MOM",
            "description": "ELENA, 60s, is tending rows of winter kale. She doesn't stop working when Maya\napproaches.\nELENA\nYou the one who's been asking about hydroponics at\nthe library?\nMAYA\nYes.\nELENA\nYou don't have soil. So you're growing indoors.\nMAYA\nRooftop. Maybe indoors eventually.\nELENA\n(still not looking up)\nWhy?\nMAYA\nBecause I think the stores are going to stop.\nElena pauses. She looks at Maya for a long moment.\nELENA\nYou're not the first person to feel that.\nMAYA\nI might be the first one doing something about it.\nElena sets down her trowel.\nMAYA AND HER MOM",
